  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "卡其格子的樱花屋",
        "en": "The khaki-check Sakura version"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A444-18/318dc0414711.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "这款是卡其色格子的樱花屋造型，带布艺屋顶、门帘与房屋窗口。盒面说明可组装、折叠，并注明室内及户外游戏场景，方便按实际位置布置。",
        "en": "This Sakura version has khaki checks, a fabric roof, doorway curtain and house-style windows. The box describes assembly and folding, with indoor and outdoor play shown as uses."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "先量好位置，再搭建",
        "en": "Measure the space before assembly"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A444-18/3c4cc59c1f16.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "搭建后的尺寸为120 × 100 × 130 cm。摆放前先量好游戏区，给门口进出留出位置；套装随附组装说明书，可按说明核对部件和搭建顺序。",
        "en": "The assembled dimensions are 120 × 100 × 130 cm. Measure the play area and leave room at the doorway. Assembly instructions are included for checking the parts and order of assembly."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "布艺结构与彩盒包装",
        "en": "Fabric construction and packing"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A444-18/f7420ddae734.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "商品为布艺游戏屋，具体门帘、窗口和接缝可查看细节图。采用43 × 10 × 26 cm彩盒包装；布置场景用到的玩偶或其他陈设不计入本款已列配件。",
        "en": "The detail images show the fabric, doorway, windows and seams. The color box measures 43 × 10 × 26 cm. Dolls or other items used to style a scene are not listed accessories for this model."
      }
    }
  ],
